      "writtenOn": "2025-12-12T15:58:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, what they said.\nThe original code used checked_sub and would have panicked on an underflow if 0 was passed. This patchset uses wrapping_sub instead, to wrap around to u32::MAX without panicking, and keys.get safely handles that since it’s a HashMap lookup rather than an array index. The intent was mostly to remove the (minor) possibility of a panic.\nRegardless, if a checked-sub + match + early return seems better, please let me know and I\u0027ll send a new patchset.",
      "parentUuid": "fadfb304_38553e15",
      "revId": "92f7abf694fbe567cc5c365145ac8489548a88db",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
